  Sterling Trading Tech and Atlas Digital Markets announce a technology collaboration that brings Atlas's transaction cost analysis engine into the Sterling OMS 360 and Sterling Data Warehouse, giving Sterling's clients execution-quality measurement on their own complete order and execution data from Q4 2026.
ogImage: /og/og-news-sterling-2026-10.png
